{"lines": {"H1": {"t0": 0.45, "t1": 6.012, "text": "Laddoo Lab has ads, offers and ten shops. But few people know the story behind it.", "words": [{"w": "Laddoo", "t": 0.45}, {"w": "Lab", "t": 0.856}, {"w": "has", "t": 1.114}, {"w": "ads,", "t": 1.372}, {"w": "offers", "t": 1.778}, {"w": "and", "t": 2.185}, {"w": "ten", "t": 2.443}, {"w": "shops.", "t": 2.7}, {"w": "But", "t": 3.305}, {"w": "few", "t": 3.563}, {"w": "people", "t": 3.821}, {"w": "know", "t": 4.227}, {"w": "the", "t": 4.535}, {"w": "story", "t": 4.792}, {"w": "behind", "t": 5.149}, {"w": "it.", "t": 5.556}]}, "H2": {"t0": 6.312, "t1": 9.134, "text": "Then a local reporter visits Nani's kitchen.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "t": 6.312}, {"w": "a", "t": 6.622}, {"w": "local", "t": 6.782}, {"w": "reporter", "t": 7.142}, {"w": "visits", "t": 7.653}, {"w": "Nani's", "t": 8.063}, {"w": "kitchen.", "t": 8.423}]}, "C2": {"t0": 9.684, "t1": 14.096, "text": "The next morning, Nani is in the newspaper. And that week, orders jump.", "words": [{"w": "The", "t": 9.684}, {"w": "next", "t": 9.914}, {"w": "morning,", "t": 10.189}, {"w": "Nani", "t": 10.729}, {"w": "is", "t": 11.004}, {"w": "in", "t": 11.19}, {"w": "the", "t": 11.376}, {"w": "newspaper.", "t": 11.606}, {"w": "And", "t": 12.324}, {"w": "that", "t": 12.554}, {"w": "week,", "t": 12.829}, {"w": "orders", "t": 13.237}, {"w": "jump.", "t": 13.6}]}, "L1": {"t0": 14.746, "t1": 17.949, "text": "Zoya did not pay for that story. She earned it.", "words": [{"w": "Zoya", "t": 14.746}, {"w": "did", "t": 15.038}, {"w": "not", "t": 15.283}, {"w": "pay", "t": 15.528}, {"w": "for", "t": 15.773}, {"w": "that", "t": 16.018}, {"w": "story.", "t": 16.31}, {"w": "She", "t": 16.885}, {"w": "earned", "t": 17.129}, {"w": "it.", "t": 17.516}]}, "L2": {"t0": 18.299, "t1": 24.076, "text": "The reporter came because the story was real: a grandmother's millet recipe, made by hand.", "words": [{"w": "The", "t": 18.299}, {"w": "reporter", "t": 18.558}, {"w": "came", "t": 19.066}, {"w": "because", "t": 19.375}, {"w": "the", "t": 19.833}, {"w": "story", "t": 20.092}, {"w": "was", "t": 20.451}, {"w": "real:", "t": 20.71}, {"w": "a", "t": 21.168}, {"w": "grandmother's", "t": 21.327}, {"w": "millet", "t": 22.034}, {"w": "recipe,", "t": 22.443}, {"w": "made", "t": 23.0}, {"w": "by", "t": 23.309}, {"w": "hand.", "t": 23.518}]}, "L3": {"t0": 24.426, "t1": 27.736, "text": "This is the power of public relations, or PR.", "words": [{"w": "This", "t": 24.426}, {"w": "is", "t": 24.742}, {"w": "the", "t": 24.956}, {"w": "power", "t": 25.221}, {"w": "of", "t": 25.587}, {"w": "public", "t": 25.801}, {"w": "relations,", "t": 26.219}, {"w": "or", "t": 26.942}, {"w": "PR.", "t": 27.156}]}, "D1": {"t0": 28.386, "t1": 30.311, "text": "So what is public relations?", "words": [{"w": "So", "t": 28.386}, {"w": "what", "t": 28.594}, {"w": "is", "t": 28.899}, {"w": "public", "t": 29.107}, {"w": "relations?", "t": 29.511}]}, "D2": {"t0": 30.611, "t1": 40.92, "text": "Kotler and Armstrong call it building good relations with the company's publics, by earning good publicity, building a good image, and handling bad rumours and stories.", "words": [{"w": "Kotler", "t": 30.611}, {"w": "and", "t": 31.015}, {"w": "Armstrong", "t": 31.271}, {"w": "call", "t": 31.823}, {"w": "it", "t": 32.128}, {"w": "building", "t": 32.335}, {"w": "good", "t": 32.838}, {"w": "relations", "t": 33.143}, {"w": "with", "t": 33.695}, {"w": "the", "t": 34.001}, {"w": "company's", "t": 34.257}, {"w": "publics,", "t": 34.76}, {"w": "by", "t": 35.361}, {"w": "earning", "t": 35.568}, {"w": "good", "t": 36.021}, {"w": "publicity,", "t": 36.327}, {"w": "building", "t": 37.027}, {"w": "a", "t": 37.529}, {"w": "good", "t": 37.687}, {"w": "image,", "t": 37.992}, {"w": "and", "t": 38.495}, {"w": "handling", "t": 38.751}, {"w": "bad", "t": 39.254}, {"w": "rumours", "t": 39.51}, {"w": "and", "t": 39.964}, {"w": "stories.", "t": 40.22}]}, "D3": {"t0": 41.27, "t1": 48.168, "text": "A public is any group that cares about your brand: customers, neighbours, the press, shopkeepers, even the government.", "words": [{"w": "A", "t": 41.27}, {"w": "public", "t": 41.412}, {"w": "is", "t": 41.778}, {"w": "any", "t": 41.966}, {"w": "group", "t": 42.198}, {"w": "that", "t": 42.519}, {"w": "cares", "t": 42.796}, {"w": "about", "t": 43.117}, {"w": "your", "t": 43.438}, {"w": "brand:", "t": 43.715}, {"w": "customers,", "t": 44.17}, {"w": "neighbours,", "t": 44.803}, {"w": "the", "t": 45.482}, {"w": "press,", "t": 45.714}, {"w": "shopkeepers,", "t": 46.169}, {"w": "even", "t": 46.892}, {"w": "the", "t": 47.168}, {"w": "government.", "t": 47.4}]}, "M0": {"t0": 48.818, "t1": 51.505, "text": "Let's see how the Nani story really happened.", "words": [{"w": "Let's", "t": 48.818}, {"w": "see", "t": 49.102}, {"w": "how", "t": 49.34}, {"w": "the", "t": 49.579}, {"w": "Nani", "t": 49.817}, {"w": "story", "t": 50.102}, {"w": "really", "t": 50.432}, {"w": "happened.", "t": 50.808}]}, "M1": {"t0": 51.855, "t1": 58.207, "text": "Step one. Find a true story. Dev notices that people love hearing about Nani's recipe.", "words": [{"w": "Step", "t": 51.855}, {"w": "one.", "t": 52.194}, {"w": "Find", "t": 52.753}, {"w": "a", "t": 53.092}, {"w": "true", "t": 53.267}, {"w": "story.", "t": 53.607}, {"w": "Dev", "t": 54.275}, {"w": "notices", "t": 54.56}, {"w": "that", "t": 55.064}, {"w": "people", "t": 55.403}, {"w": "love", "t": 55.852}, {"w": "hearing", "t": 56.192}, {"w": "about", "t": 56.696}, {"w": "Nani's", "t": 57.09}, {"w": "recipe.", "t": 57.484}]}, "M2": {"t0": 58.557, "t1": 65.277, "text": "Step two. Write it down. Dev writes a short press release, a one-page news note for reporters.", "words": [{"w": "Step", "t": 58.557}, {"w": "two.", "t": 58.882}, {"w": "Write", "t": 59.415}, {"w": "it", "t": 59.792}, {"w": "down.", "t": 60.012}, {"w": "Dev", "t": 60.598}, {"w": "writes", "t": 60.87}, {"w": "a", "t": 61.3}, {"w": "short", "t": 61.467}, {"w": "press", "t": 61.844}, {"w": "release,", "t": 62.221}, {"w": "a", "t": 62.859}, {"w": "one-page", "t": 63.027}, {"w": "news", "t": 63.508}, {"w": "note", "t": 63.833}, {"w": "for", "t": 64.157}, {"w": "reporters.", "t": 64.429}]}, "M3": {"t0": 65.627, "t1": 72.225, "text": "Step three. Invite the press. Zoya asks a local reporter to a tasting in Nani's kitchen.", "words": [{"w": "Step", "t": 65.627}, {"w": "three.", "t": 65.97}, {"w": "Invite", "t": 66.646}, {"w": "the", "t": 67.099}, {"w": "press.", "t": 67.387}, {"w": "Zoya", "t": 68.063}, {"w": "asks", "t": 68.406}, {"w": "a", "t": 68.749}, {"w": "local", "t": 68.926}, {"w": "reporter", "t": 69.325}, {"w": "to", "t": 69.889}, {"w": "a", "t": 70.122}, {"w": "tasting", "t": 70.299}, {"w": "in", "t": 70.808}, {"w": "Nani's", "t": 71.041}, {"w": "kitchen.", "t": 71.439}]}, "M4": {"t0": 72.575, "t1": 78.895, "text": "Step four. The story runs. A photo of Nani, and a headline about healthy tiffin sweets.", "words": [{"w": "Step", "t": 72.575}, {"w": "four.", "t": 72.899}, {"w": "The", "t": 73.483}, {"w": "story", "t": 73.754}, {"w": "runs.", "t": 74.129}, {"w": "A", "t": 74.713}, {"w": "photo", "t": 74.88}, {"w": "of", "t": 75.256}, {"w": "Nani,", "t": 75.475}, {"w": "and", "t": 75.954}, {"w": "a", "t": 76.226}, {"w": "headline", "t": 76.393}, {"w": "about", "t": 76.924}, {"w": "healthy", "t": 77.3}, {"w": "tiffin", "t": 77.78}, {"w": "sweets.", "t": 78.207}]}, "M5": {"t0": 79.245, "t1": 84.532, "text": "Step five. Share it. Dev posts the story, and every shop sticks it up by the counter.", "words": [{"w": "Step", "t": 79.245}, {"w": "five.", "t": 79.518}, {"w": "Share", "t": 80.009}, {"w": "it.", "t": 80.326}, {"w": "Dev", "t": 80.73}, {"w": "posts", "t": 80.958}, {"w": "the", "t": 81.274}, {"w": "story,", "t": 81.502}, {"w": "and", "t": 81.95}, {"w": "every", "t": 82.178}, {"w": "shop", "t": 82.495}, {"w": "sticks", "t": 82.767}, {"w": "it", "t": 83.127}, {"w": "up", "t": 83.311}, {"w": "by", "t": 83.496}, {"w": "the", "t": 83.68}, {"w": "counter.", "t": 83.908}]}, "T1": {"t0": 85.182, "t1": 87.978, "text": "Ads are paid for. Good stories are earned.", "words": [{"w": "Ads", "t": 85.182}, {"w": "are", "t": 85.422}, {"w": "paid", "t": 85.662}, {"w": "for.", "t": 85.948}, {"w": "Good", "t": 86.418}, {"w": "stories", "t": 86.704}, {"w": "are", "t": 87.129}, {"w": "earned.", "t": 87.369}]}, "P0": {"t0": 88.678, "t1": 93.21, "text": "A story in the news is just one PR tool. Here are three more.", "words": [{"w": "A", "t": 88.678}, {"w": "story", "t": 88.841}, {"w": "in", "t": 89.207}, {"w": "the", "t": 89.421}, {"w": "news", "t": 89.686}, {"w": "is", "t": 90.002}, {"w": "just", "t": 90.216}, {"w": "one", "t": 90.531}, {"w": "PR", "t": 90.796}, {"w": "tool.", "t": 91.122}, {"w": "Here", "t": 91.692}, {"w": "are", "t": 92.008}, {"w": "three", "t": 92.273}, {"w": "more.", "t": 92.64}]}, "P1": {"t0": 93.56, "t1": 97.692, "text": "Events. Laddoo Lab runs a millet tasting at a school fair.", "words": [{"w": "Events.", "t": 93.56}, {"w": "Laddoo", "t": 94.24}, {"w": "Lab", "t": 94.662}, {"w": "runs", "t": 94.93}, {"w": "a", "t": 95.25}, {"w": "millet", "t": 95.415}, {"w": "tasting", "t": 95.837}, {"w": "at", "t": 96.311}, {"w": "a", "t": 96.527}, {"w": "school", "t": 96.692}, {"w": "fair.", "t": 97.115}]}, "P2": {"t0": 98.042, "t1": 102.598, "text": "Community work. Nani teaches a free healthy-snack class for parents.", "words": [{"w": "Community", "t": 98.042}, {"w": "work.", "t": 98.621}, {"w": "Nani", "t": 99.201}, {"w": "teaches", "t": 99.522}, {"w": "a", "t": 99.999}, {"w": "free", "t": 100.164}, {"w": "healthy-snack", "t": 100.485}, {"w": "class", "t": 101.221}, {"w": "for", "t": 101.593}, {"w": "parents.", "t": 101.863}]}, "P3": {"t0": 102.948, "t1": 108.162, "text": "And social media. Dev answers every question from parents, kindly and quickly.", "words": [{"w": "And", "t": 102.948}, {"w": "social", "t": 103.21}, {"w": "media.", "t": 103.624}, {"w": "Dev", "t": 104.239}, {"w": "answers", "t": 104.501}, {"w": "every", "t": 104.965}, {"w": "question", "t": 105.328}, {"w": "from", "t": 105.843}, {"w": "parents,", "t": 106.155}, {"w": "kindly", "t": 106.771}, {"w": "and", "t": 107.184}, {"w": "quickly.", "t": 107.446}]}, "K0": {"t0": 108.812, "t1": 110.779, "text": "Where do we see this at work today?", "words": [{"w": "Where", "t": 108.812}, {"w": "do", "t": 109.098}, {"w": "we", "t": 109.264}, {"w": "see", "t": 109.431}, {"w": "this", "t": 109.637}, {"w": "at", "t": 109.883}, {"w": "work", "t": 110.05}, {"w": "today?", "t": 110.295}]}, "K1": {"t0": 111.129, "t1": 115.636, "text": "News. A hospital shares its new heart unit with the local paper.", "words": [{"w": "News.", "t": 111.129}, {"w": "A", "t": 111.707}, {"w": "hospital", "t": 111.872}, {"w": "shares", "t": 112.398}, {"w": "its", "t": 112.821}, {"w": "new", "t": 113.089}, {"w": "heart", "t": 113.357}, {"w": "unit", "t": 113.728}, {"w": "with", "t": 114.048}, {"w": "the", "t": 114.368}, {"w": "local", "t": 114.636}, {"w": "paper.", "t": 115.007}]}, "K2": {"t0": 115.986, "t1": 120.066, "text": "Events. A bank runs a free money class for college students.", "words": [{"w": "Events.", "t": 115.986}, {"w": "A", "t": 116.642}, {"w": "bank", "t": 116.8}, {"w": "runs", "t": 117.108}, {"w": "a", "t": 117.416}, {"w": "free", "t": 117.575}, {"w": "money", "t": 117.882}, {"w": "class", "t": 118.24}, {"w": "for", "t": 118.597}, {"w": "college", "t": 118.855}, {"w": "students.", "t": 119.312}]}, "K3": {"t0": 120.416, "t1": 125.26, "text": "Community work. A bakery gives its extra bread to a shelter every night.", "words": [{"w": "Community", "t": 120.416}, {"w": "work.", "t": 120.978}, {"w": "A", "t": 121.539}, {"w": "bakery", "t": 121.7}, {"w": "gives", "t": 122.111}, {"w": "its", "t": 122.472}, {"w": "extra", "t": 122.733}, {"w": "bread", "t": 123.094}, {"w": "to", "t": 123.455}, {"w": "a", "t": 123.665}, {"w": "shelter", "t": 123.826}, {"w": "every", "t": 124.287}, {"w": "night.", "t": 124.648}]}, "K4": {"t0": 125.61, "t1": 130.462, "text": "Handling bad news. An airline explains a delay quickly and honestly.", "words": [{"w": "Handling", "t": 125.61}, {"w": "bad", "t": 126.158}, {"w": "news.", "t": 126.438}, {"w": "An", "t": 127.041}, {"w": "airline", "t": 127.266}, {"w": "explains", "t": 127.761}, {"w": "a", "t": 128.31}, {"w": "delay", "t": 128.482}, {"w": "quickly", "t": 128.869}, {"w": "and", "t": 129.364}, {"w": "honestly.", "t": 129.644}]}, "X1": {"t0": 131.112, "t1": 134.269, "text": "But is PR always in your control? No.", "words": [{"w": "But", "t": 131.112}, {"w": "is", "t": 131.396}, {"w": "PR", "t": 131.625}, {"w": "always", "t": 131.975}, {"w": "in", "t": 132.423}, {"w": "your", "t": 132.652}, {"w": "control?", "t": 132.991}, {"w": "No.", "t": 133.766}]}, "X2": {"t0": 134.619, "t1": 139.545, "text": "The good side. People trust a news story more than an ad, and it costs little.", "words": [{"w": "The", "t": 134.619}, {"w": "good", "t": 134.856}, {"w": "side.", "t": 135.138}, {"w": "People", "t": 135.648}, {"w": "trust", "t": 136.021}, {"w": "a", "t": 136.349}, {"w": "news", "t": 136.495}, {"w": "story", "t": 136.777}, {"w": "more", "t": 137.105}, {"w": "than", "t": 137.387}, {"w": "an", "t": 137.669}, {"w": "ad,", "t": 137.86}, {"w": "and", "t": 138.188}, {"w": "it", "t": 138.425}, {"w": "costs", "t": 138.616}, {"w": "little.", "t": 138.944}]}, "X3": {"t0": 139.895, "t1": 145.52, "text": "The hard side. You can't control what reporters write. And bad news spreads fast.", "words": [{"w": "The", "t": 139.895}, {"w": "hard", "t": 140.161}, {"w": "side.", "t": 140.479}, {"w": "You", "t": 141.053}, {"w": "can't", "t": 141.319}, {"w": "control", "t": 141.637}, {"w": "what", "t": 142.108}, {"w": "reporters", "t": 142.426}, {"w": "write.", "t": 142.999}, {"w": "And", "t": 143.624}, {"w": "bad", "t": 143.891}, {"w": "news", "t": 144.157}, {"w": "spreads", "t": 144.475}, {"w": "fast.", "t": 144.946}]}, "X4": {"t0": 145.87, "t1": 152.853, "text": "One day, a parent posts that a pack was stale. Zoya replies that same d